  "details": "Write a script to validate avatar packages for:\n - Easy: \n    - corrupt packages\n - Harder:\n    - packages that do not adhere to avatar rules such as far over limits, etc.\n    - known heuristics for crasher avatars\n    - known avatar hashes of problematic avatars\nAny other filtering you can think of could be used, but mainly the filtering for corrupt packages should be easy to set up a CI type script for and would be invaluable for preventing player grief.\nThank you for your time and consideration!\n(I appreciate you all! I hope I see you in game soon!)",
